WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:54.260 --> 01:55.420
Stop!

01:59.260 --> 02:01.350
I'm a police officer!

02:01.350 --> 02:03.390
You're guilty of robbery and...

02:07.520 --> 02:08.480
...you're under arrest!

02:32.000 --> 02:38.670
Ah, the Beautiful Heart of an Officer

02:38.920 --> 02:41.470
There's been another robbery.

02:41.470 --> 02:42.970
This is the fifth time.

02:42.970 --> 02:44.260
I'm scared!

02:44.260 --> 02:46.680
What are the police doing?

02:46.680 --> 02:48.480
Really, what are they doing?

02:48.480 --> 02:52.810
This won't end as long as the robber is loose.

02:52.810 --> 02:57.400
I know! I'll arrest him for sure!

02:57.400 --> 02:58.490
What?!

02:58.490 --> 03:00.490
I'm the daughter of a detective.

03:00.490 --> 03:02.700
I can't sit on my butt and just watch...

03:02.700 --> 03:04.990
...when the reputation of the police is at stake.

03:04.990 --> 03:09.250
It's not safe to get involved in crimes like that!

03:09.250 --> 03:10.580
- I have to agree.

03:11.210 --> 03:12.250
Chiaki!

03:12.540 --> 03:15.130
You should stop putting yourself in danger.

03:15.130 --> 03:15.960
What?

03:15.960 --> 03:18.800
Do you really worry about me?

03:18.800 --> 03:20.220
Of course.

03:20.220 --> 03:24.550
Every man cares about cute girls.

03:24.550 --> 03:26.680
I'm so happy!

03:26.680 --> 03:27.600
Geh!

03:27.600 --> 03:31.770
That's right! Chiaki, would you walk home with me after school?

03:31.770 --> 03:37.400
Lately, Pakkyamlamao-sensei has been really strict and practice ends really late.

03:37.400 --> 03:39.440
I'd be really happy if you would!

03:39.440 --> 03:43.860
Sure! But I might become a wolf.

03:43.860 --> 03:50.410
Then I'm the sheep? Oh no, I'll be eaten!

03:51.500 --> 03:52.830
What about you, Maron?

03:52.830 --> 03:56.880
I'll walk home with you, too, since we all live near each other.

03:56.880 --> 03:58.170
What are you talking about?

03:58.170 --> 04:02.800
I don't need some weak guy to walk me home!

04:16.440 --> 04:19.020
Ah, Chiaki!

04:19.530 --> 04:21.860
You really waited for me!

04:21.860 --> 04:23.030
Of course.

04:29.120 --> 04:31.620
What's wrong, Maron? I'll walk home with you, too.

04:31.620 --> 04:32.710
I'm fine.

04:32.710 --> 04:34.620
What are you so mad about?

04:35.210 --> 04:37.290
You're going to be targeted by a mugger.

04:39.250 --> 04:42.380
Geez, she's so uptight!

04:42.380 --> 04:44.970
Chiaki, hurry up!

04:44.970 --> 04:46.340
Oh, sure.

04:50.890 --> 04:52.060
Whatever!

04:53.270 --> 04:57.020
I'll beat the mugger if he appears.

04:58.480 --> 05:01.400
Miyako, that's the long way around.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.030
I know, I know.

05:03.030 --> 05:05.400
You didn't have to choose the darker path.

05:09.030 --> 05:13.370
There's a higher chance of the robber appearing in a darker place.

05:13.370 --> 05:17.790
Hey, hey. Were you serious about catching the robber?

05:17.790 --> 05:20.540
Of course. And...

05:20.540 --> 05:21.800
And?

05:26.130 --> 05:27.340
What's wrong?

05:27.340 --> 05:29.050
Could it be...?

05:34.560 --> 05:35.940
It's only a cat.

05:38.560 --> 05:40.900
I knew that from the start.

05:41.440 --> 05:42.900
Eh?

06:03.340 --> 06:07.170
I'm so stupid...

06:17.100 --> 06:18.850
<i>Yes, Kusakabe residence.</i>

06:19.690 --> 06:22.690
<i>Mama! Thanks for the present!</i>

06:22.690 --> 06:26.110
<i>What? Another project?</i>

06:26.110 --> 06:29.410
<i>I just got back...</i>

06:29.410 --> 06:33.620
<i>Yes, that's my department...</i>

06:33.620 --> 06:37.450
<i>But can't it wait until tomorrow...?</i>

06:37.450 --> 06:41.790
<i>Yes.. Yes, I have to do that by tonight...</i>

06:41.790 --> 06:43.590
<i>But...</i>

06:43.590 --> 06:46.260
<i>Mama, you can go to work.</i>

06:46.260 --> 06:47.050
<i>Eh?</i>

06:47.050 --> 06:53.510
<i>I can stay by myself. I can sleep by myself.</i>

06:53.510 --> 06:55.220
<i>I'm sorry, Maron...</i>

06:56.350 --> 06:57.810
<i>I'll be right there.</i>

06:59.640 --> 07:05.190
<i>Papa should be home soon, so can you stay by yourself until then?</i>

07:05.190 --> 07:08.860
<i>Sure, Mama. See ya later.</i>

07:18.870 --> 07:23.380
Happy Birthday

07:18.870 --> 07:23.380
Maron

07:35.430 --> 07:38.600
Back then, I was so lonely all the time.

07:38.600 --> 07:40.730
It's the same, even now.

08:04.540 --> 08:05.330
Hey!

08:20.100 --> 08:23.140
Chiaki...

08:23.140 --> 08:26.610
What's wrong? You're in a hurry.

08:26.610 --> 08:29.270
Were you scared to walk home alone?

08:29.270 --> 08:31.320
It's nothing like that!

08:31.320 --> 08:34.070
Why are you standing here, anyway?

08:36.660 --> 08:38.330
Because the moon is beautiful.

08:41.330 --> 08:42.620
What's wrong?

08:42.620 --> 08:45.670
Some weird pervert was following me, so I made him chase me here.

08:53.720 --> 08:56.840
Maron-chan, you're such a fast runner!

08:56.840 --> 08:59.560
I couldn't catch up to you.

09:01.430 --> 09:03.180
Haruta-san...

09:05.140 --> 09:10.520
You're finally here! Everyone's tired of waiting.

09:10.520 --> 09:12.530
Miyako-san, I'm sorry.

09:12.530 --> 09:15.950
Hurry, hurry. You two can come, too. Let's eat dinner together.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.450
It's a party tonight!

09:17.450 --> 09:18.950
Sounds good...

09:19.490 --> 09:20.870
What's it for?

09:20.870 --> 09:22.870
To make Officer Haruta happy.

09:45.890 --> 09:48.980
I'm so disappointed in myself!

09:48.980 --> 09:51.270
Not only did I let the robber escape...

09:51.270 --> 09:54.610
Maron-chan thought <i><b>I was the robber!</b></i>

09:54.610 --> 09:56.900
Hey, hey, don't cry, Haruta.

09:56.900 --> 09:58.530
Yeah, drink, drink!

09:58.530 --> 10:01.200
- Drink and forget our problems!

09:58.530 --> 10:01.200
- Haruta-san...

10:01.200 --> 10:03.700
He's such a crybaby...

10:04.330 --> 10:07.040
That was my bad.

10:08.370 --> 10:11.460
Drink more, Haruta!

10:11.460 --> 10:13.630
Do you want some too, Chiaki-kun?

10:13.630 --> 10:15.130
No, Akita-san!

10:15.130 --> 10:18.340
What kind of police officer would offer alcohol to a teenager?

10:18.340 --> 10:22.260
Hey, what were you and Chiaki doing downstairs?

10:22.260 --> 10:25.520
If you like Chiaki, just come out and say it!

10:25.520 --> 10:27.890
Don't do anything secretly.

10:27.890 --> 10:31.900
Who would have feelings for that guy?!

10:31.900 --> 10:36.780
Miyako-san! What are you two whispering to each other about?

10:36.780 --> 10:38.110
Let's sing!

10:38.110 --> 10:41.870
I can drink a lot tonight!!!

10:41.870 --> 10:46.330
All thanks to Detective Toudaiji!!

10:46.330 --> 10:55.420
Thank you, Detective Toudaiji!!

11:00.970 --> 11:04.430
Oh, sorry! I'm really sorry...

11:04.430 --> 11:06.970
What? Isn't this...?

11:13.810 --> 11:15.820
I see...

11:15.820 --> 11:19.610
The statue is complete now.

11:19.610 --> 11:22.700
You were watching this whole time...

11:22.700 --> 11:26.290
...and saw my most embarrassing moment...

11:26.290 --> 11:31.580
However! I, Haruta, will catch that robber...

11:31.580 --> 11:38.420
...and make 'em pay! I promise!

11:38.420 --> 11:42.470
Even though you're a statue, you sure are pretty.

11:48.390 --> 11:51.350
Ow...my chest...it hurts...

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
Notice

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
Don't go away!

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
I'll return right after these messages!

11:59.360 --> 12:01.990
Kaitou Jeanne

12:02.860 --> 12:05.450
Notice

12:02.860 --> 12:05.450
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:02.860 --> 12:05.450
Kaitou Jeanne

12:06.450 --> 12:10.250
Has Haruta-kun reported in yet?

12:11.210 --> 12:16.460
Something's odd. He should know about today's planning session.

12:22.630 --> 12:24.430
Well, let's go...

12:24.430 --> 12:25.840
...to Momokuri Park.

12:26.600 --> 12:30.020
Yeah. I'll catch the robber today for sure!

12:31.770 --> 12:32.980
It looks great on you!

12:32.980 --> 12:34.390
Does it really?

12:34.390 --> 12:37.440
Anyway, I don't think we need to go as far...

12:37.440 --> 12:40.530
...as disguising ourselves as ladies to fool the robber.

12:40.530 --> 12:41.650
NO!

12:41.650 --> 12:45.410
The reputation of the police is at stake. We have to do it!

12:45.410 --> 12:49.370
The plan would have been ruined if Haruta was here.

12:49.370 --> 12:53.870
I agree. The last thing I want to see is him disguised as a woman.

12:53.870 --> 12:56.290
That's so true.

12:59.460 --> 13:01.050
It's me.

13:02.380 --> 13:05.340
What?! A notice from both Jeanne and Sinbad?!

13:05.340 --> 13:09.550
The target is the statue in Momokuri Park?

13:11.060 --> 13:14.690
Damn it, we can't deal with the robber now!

13:14.690 --> 13:16.230
This is perfect!

13:16.730 --> 13:19.230
The robber, Jeanne and Sinbad...

13:19.230 --> 13:21.780
...I'll catch them all!

13:21.780 --> 13:24.780
Everyone, let's hurry to Momokuri Park!

13:24.780 --> 13:25.820
Yes, ma'am!

13:37.960 --> 13:39.920
Anything?

13:39.920 --> 13:41.420
Nope.

13:41.420 --> 13:42.670
Anyway...

13:42.670 --> 13:45.970
How do they plan on stealing this?

13:45.970 --> 13:47.050
Beats me.

13:48.510 --> 13:52.680
In any case, just don't let your guard down!

13:52.680 --> 13:54.270
Understand?

13:54.270 --> 13:55.350
Yes!

14:02.570 --> 14:05.240
The Demon is possessing the statue, right?

14:05.240 --> 14:07.650
Where's Miyako?

14:07.650 --> 14:10.570
I hope she doesn't have another trap prepared.

14:10.570 --> 14:14.120
Sinbad and Access aren't here yet.

14:14.120 --> 14:18.500
Maron, you have to seal the Demon before they do!

14:18.500 --> 14:20.130
Of course!

14:20.130 --> 14:21.500
But Fin...

14:21.500 --> 14:22.500
What is it?

14:22.500 --> 14:26.760
How many times do I have to tell you not to send the notice without my approval?!

14:26.760 --> 14:27.720
Sorry.

14:37.180 --> 14:39.600
Oh, my!

14:46.400 --> 14:47.740
We did it!

14:51.110 --> 14:52.070
Stop!

14:52.070 --> 14:53.780
Stop right there!

14:53.780 --> 14:55.870
I'm telling you to stop, damn it!!

15:00.750 --> 15:02.540
Heh. It's the guy I beat last time.

15:04.590 --> 15:07.920
I see you want to get beaten again.

15:20.940 --> 15:21.850
Haruta!

15:28.110 --> 15:29.070
Haruta!

15:29.070 --> 15:30.900
That's enough!

15:30.900 --> 15:33.410
If you keep it up...

15:33.410 --> 15:36.080
...he'll die!

15:37.870 --> 15:41.250
Everyone's attention is focused on the robber.

15:42.170 --> 15:43.380
Now's the time!

15:43.380 --> 15:44.460
Okay!

15:50.760 --> 15:51.930
Let's go!

15:55.350 --> 15:58.430
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

16:08.610 --> 16:10.780
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:10.780 --> 16:12.780
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:12.780 --> 16:14.360
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:17.160 --> 16:18.240
<i>Game Start!</i>

16:20.000 --> 16:24.960
Jeanne, Miyako-chan and some officers should be around here. Be careful!

16:24.960 --> 16:26.590
I know.

16:26.590 --> 16:28.500
I'm always...!

16:31.670 --> 16:32.630
Now!

16:39.600 --> 16:42.310
Miyako Special, Part Seven!

16:42.310 --> 16:44.850
Today is your last day, Jeanne!

16:51.780 --> 16:54.070
Nice job, Jeanne!

16:54.070 --> 16:56.450
Thanks for showing us the trap!

16:57.740 --> 16:59.740
It's Sinbad! Stop him!

17:04.330 --> 17:05.710
Don't let Jeanne escape!

17:06.580 --> 17:08.130
Jeanne...

17:20.350 --> 17:21.640
Chase her!

17:22.560 --> 17:25.810
<i>Jeanne and Sinbad are past the guards!</i>

17:25.810 --> 17:27.480
Damn them...

17:27.480 --> 17:31.360
Everyone, get in your positions! Protect the statue!

17:42.410 --> 17:43.700
Haruta...

17:54.970 --> 17:58.340
God, what's going on now?

17:59.760 --> 18:01.260
Wait!

18:02.930 --> 18:04.220
Don't let them get away!

18:05.680 --> 18:08.600
Hey! Stop it!!

18:08.600 --> 18:11.520
What's gotten into you, Haruta-san?!

18:17.610 --> 18:20.070
What the...? In-fighting?!

18:28.420 --> 18:29.620
What the...?!

18:31.500 --> 18:33.590
This power...

18:35.800 --> 18:38.130
He's possessed!

18:40.050 --> 18:40.970
Haruta-san!

18:40.970 --> 18:42.760
Stop, Jeanne!

18:51.810 --> 18:54.150
In the name of God...

18:55.280 --> 18:57.490
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

18:57.490 --> 18:59.650
I seal you here!

18:59.650 --> 19:01.110
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:19.880 --> 19:21.130
All right!!!

19:26.510 --> 19:27.930
Job well done!

19:28.810 --> 19:30.730
What the...? What happened?!

19:32.060 --> 19:36.190
You should seriously consider retirement, Jeanne!

19:37.900 --> 19:40.570
Everyone, what are you doing?!

19:40.570 --> 19:41.570
Hurry!

19:41.570 --> 19:43.530
Hurry up and catch her!

19:50.580 --> 19:54.000
<i>You're unfit for this job.</i>

20:01.010 --> 20:04.260
I'm so mad...

20:06.180 --> 20:10.850
Hey, hey, we'll catch her next time.

20:10.850 --> 20:14.270
We caught the robber...

20:14.270 --> 20:17.150
...so the police should be happy.

20:17.150 --> 20:18.900
All thanks to Haruta.

20:18.900 --> 20:20.820
Indeed...

20:20.820 --> 20:22.860
By the way, Haruta...

20:22.860 --> 20:26.910
...when did you learn those martial arts?

20:26.910 --> 20:29.290
What are you talking about?

20:29.290 --> 20:31.370
You're so humble, Haruta.

20:31.370 --> 20:33.160
Really!

20:33.160 --> 20:34.620
Fuyuta...

20:35.380 --> 20:38.170
Stop doing that...

20:52.060 --> 20:54.560
Maron...

20:54.560 --> 20:56.730
Maron!

20:56.730 --> 21:02.530
Don't be depressed! If you're gone, no one can protect the world!

21:02.530 --> 21:08.070
I know. I'm always: "Strong and serious, matchless and marvelous."

21:30.930 --> 21:34.560
<i>"Don't cry. Always smile...</i>

21:34.560 --> 21:38.860
<i>...and see a happy dream, baby!"</i>

21:39.980 --> 21:44.490
That Chiaki! Does he have to tease me like this?!

21:44.490 --> 21:48.370
But it's the first time there was mail in there.

21:48.370 --> 21:51.120
I'm not happy at all!!

21:53.870 --> 21:55.620
<i>That's right...</i>

21:57.000 --> 21:59.380
<i>I'm not...</i>

21:59.380 --> 22:02.840
...happy.

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.550 --> 23:36.140
No matter how enviable a relationship is, a couple will break up sooner or later.

23:36.140 --> 23:37.680
It's fate.

23:37.680 --> 23:39.230
I don't accept that!

23:39.230 --> 23:42.520
Even if they're destined to meet, the rest of it is in their power!

23:42.520 --> 23:45.230
There are couples that break up, no matter what.

23:45.230 --> 23:48.400
If breaking up is their fate, then why did they even meet in the first place?

23:48.400 --> 23:51.530
Don't use the word "fate" so easily!

23:51.530 --> 23:55.620
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: The Pin Is Mightier than the Sword!

23:55.620 --> 23:59.250
I'll change this sad destiny!
